{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F8XBp1YeZKYPW93gvQeDZc","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# trace-verdict-study — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-18 11:06 UTC | 更新原因: 用户要求冲 main，完整实验规划写入（P0/P1/P2 三级 + GPU 预算）\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nException events 是 test verdict prediction 的 minimal sufficient signal：跨 4 模型、3 架构家族、1.5B-13B scale 范围内达到 ≥99.33% accuracy。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research + 审稿进行中，用户要求冲 EMNLP main\\\\n- **实验**: 99 个（成功 64），4×5 budget curve 矩阵剩 3 格\\\\n- **关键结果**: CodeLlama tail-1024 v3 label_only_loss=98.24%（修复验证成功）\\\\n- **Paper Agent**: Patch 7 完成（4 模型 budget curve + tokenizer efficiency 整合）\\\\n- **Reviewer**: API Error 400 系统性故障，已升级 Manager 要 ETA\\\\n- **EMNLP ARR DDL**: 2026-05-25（7 天）\\\\n\\\\n## 核心发现\\\\n- exception_only: 99.33-100% 跨 4 模型 3 家族\\\\n- Phase transition at 256→512: 四模型跃变 +14.7~+23pp\\\\n- tail-512 convergence: 四模型 93.6-97.5%\\\\n- tail-1024 convergence: 96.5-98.2%（CodeLlama 最高，13B scale 边际优势）\\\\n- Head-tail gap: 15.5-22.6pp，小模型 gap 更大\\\\n- Signal-poor convergence band: head-2048 (75-82%) ≈ tail-256 (72-79%)\\\\n- label_only_loss 修复 CodeLlama loss dilution: 87.6% → 98.24%\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n- cuda:0: `qwen7b_full_trace_head2048_seed42`（填满 4×5 矩阵最后一格之一）\\\\n- cuda:1: `codellama13b_full_trace_tail2048_seed42_v3`（label_only_loss，step ~200/444）\\\\n\\\\n## 实验规划（冲 main 完整路线）\\\\n\\\\n### P0 — 必须完成（~20 GPU-hours）\\\\n- [x] 4×5 budget curve 矩阵（剩 Qwen-7B head-2048 + CodeLlama tail-1024/2048）\\\\n- [ ] CodeLlama 基础 ablation: no_trace / vota / exception_only（3 个 queued）\\\\n- [ ] Qwen-1.5B 基础 ablation: no_trace / vota / exception_only / full_trace（4 个 queued）\\\\n\\\\n### P1 — 显著提升论文质量（~40 GPU-hours）\\\\n- [ ] Fine-grained phase transition: tail-384 × 4 模型（plan_016）\\\\n- [ ] Cross-seed budget curve: tail-512 × 4 模型 × 3 seeds（plan_017）\\\\n- [ ] Error analysis: failure mode 分析（plan_018，不需 GPU）\\\\n- [ ] Cross-model calibration: 4 模型 × ECE/Brier（plan_019，纯 eval）\\\\n\\\\n### P2 — 锦上添花（~40+ GPU-hours）\\\\n- [ ] Few-shot prompting baseline: GPT-4o/Claude 直接判断（plan_020，API 调用）\\\\n- [ ] OOD generalization: 不同语言/项目的 trace（plan_021）\\\\n- [ ] Training dynamics: learning curve 分析（plan_022）\\\\n\\\\n**总预算**: ~100 GPU-hours / 可用 336 GPU-hours，资源充裕\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: westd-11235 cuda:0 + cuda:1\\\\n- 已用: ~60 GPU-hours（估）\\\\n- 剩余: ~276 GPU-hours（7 天 × 2 卡 × ~20h/天有效）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D076 | 2026-05-18 | tail-384 确认 sharp phase transition：384→512 跃变 +13- | deepseek_full_trace_tail384_seed42, qwen7b_full_trace_tail384_seed42 |\\\\n| D075 | 2026-05-18 | Error analysis (plan_018) 完成：full_trace 100% 错误在截断 | full_trace_seed42_v5, vota_exception_only_seed42_v2 |\\\\n| D074 | 2026-05-18 | CodeLlama tail-2048 v3=41.8% 接受为 outlier，不再修复；Qwen | codellama13b_full_trace_tail2048_seed42_v3, codellama13b_full_trace_tail1024_seed42_v3, qwen7b_full_trace_head2048_seed42 |\\\\n| D073 | 2026-05-18 | P0 queued 7 实验确认全部已完成（命名差异），清理重复条目；error analysis  | codellama13b_no_trace_seed42, codellama13b_vota_seed42, codellama13b_exception_only_seed42, qwen15b_no_trace_seed42, qwen15b_full_trace_seed42 |\\\\n| D072 | 2026-05-18 | CodeLlama tail-1024 v3 label_only_loss=98.24%，确认 v | codellama13b_full_trace_tail1024_seed42_v3, codellama13b_full_trace_tail1024_seed42_v2 |\\\\n| D071 | 2026-05-18 | 补跑 Qwen-7B head-2048 填满 4×5 budget curve 矩阵 | qwen7b_full_trace_head2048_seed42, deepseek_full_trace_head2048_seed42, qwen15b_full_trace_head2048_seed42, codellama13b_full_trace_head2048_seed42 |\\\\n| D070 | 2026-05-18 | CodeLlama tail-1024=87.6% 根因确认：tokenizer loss 稀释（非 | codellama13b_full_trace_tail1024_seed42_v2, codellama13b_full_trace_tail512_seed42 |\\\\n| D069 | 2026-05-18 | CodeLlama-13B head-2048=79.9% 完成 4 模型 head-2048 矩阵 | codellama13b_full_trace_head2048_seed42, qwen15b_full_trace_head2048_seed42, deepseek_full_trace_head2048_seed42 |\\\\n| D068 | 2026-05-18 | CodeLlama-13B tail-256=77.9% 完成 4 模型 tail-256 矩阵：全 | codellama13b_full_trace_tail256_seed42, full_trace_tail256_seed42, deepseek_full_trace_tail256_seed42 |\\\\n| D067 | 2026-05-18 | CodeLlama-13B tail-512=97.5% 完成 4 模型 phase transit | codellama13b_full_trace_tail512_seed42, full_trace_tail_seed42, deepseek_full_trace_tail512_seed42 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3927, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015fzUVMJswqYYmkZM5vV6Wm","session_id":"1de37377-3b2d-4064-93c3-e74486d99dc5","uuid":"11a2b54a-4a3e-494b-b7ea-bee28737ab23","timestamp":"2026-05-18T14:08:00.355Z"}
